{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[13,26,75,72,58,26],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘璋麾下谋士。刘璋为讨好曹操，派张肃率三百叟兵及杂御物出使。曹操赏识其仪表与能力，辟为丞相府掾并任命为广汉太守。张松同年出使曹操时因貌丑遭轻慢，仅获越巂令小职。张松为刘备写信要求其尽快入蜀后，被其兄张肃所发现，因惧怕自身受到牵连而向刘璋告密，也导致了张松被刘璋所斩。刘备痛惜失去内应，感叹：君矫杀吾内主乎！刘备入蜀后，张肃一度效力其麾下，但未获重用。","tc":"劉璋麾下謀士。劉璋為討好曹操，派張肅率三百叟兵及雜御物出使。曹操賞識其儀表與能力，辟為丞相府掾并任命為廣漢太守。張松同年出使曹操時因貌丑遭輕慢，僅獲越巂令小職。張松為劉備寫信要求其盡快入蜀后，被其兄張肅所發現，因懼怕自身受到牽連而向劉璋告密，也導致了張松被劉璋所斬。劉備痛惜失去內應，感嘆：君矯殺吾內主乎！劉備入蜀后，張肅一度效力其麾下，但未獲重用。","en":"An advisor under Liu Zhang. When Liu Zhang sought to ingratiate himself with Cao Cao, he dispatched Zhang Su with three hundred Sou soldiers and various gifts as an envoy. Cao Cao admired his bearing and ability, appointing him as an aide in the Prime Minister's office and naming him Governor of Guanghan. That same year, Zhang Song was sent as an envoy to Cao Cao but was slighted due to his unattractive appearance, receiving only the minor appointment of Magistrate of Yuesui. After Zhang Song wrote to Liu Bei urging him to enter Shu quickly, his elder brother Zhang Su discovered the letter and, fearing he would be implicated, reported it to Liu Zhang. This led to Zhang Song's execution by Liu Zhang. Liu Bei grieved the loss of his insider, lamenting: ‘Did you wrongfully execute my inside ally!’ After Liu Bei entered Shu, Zhang Su briefly served under him but was never given an important position.","jp":"劉璋配下の謀士。劉璋が曹操に取り入ろうとした際、張粛は叟兵三百人と雑御物を携えて使者として派遣された。曹操はその威儀と才覚を高く評価し、丞相府の掾に召し抱えて広漢太守に任命した。同年、張松が曹操のもとへ使者として赴いた際には、容貌の醜さから冷遇され、越巂令という小職を与えられるにとどまった。後に張松が劉備へ速やかに入蜀するよう促す密書を送ろうとした際、兄の張粛に露見してしまう。自身に累が及ぶことを恐れた張粛が劉璋へ密告したことで、張松は処刑されるに至った。劉備は内応者を失ったことを痛惜し、「君矯（張粛の字）は我が内主を殺したのか！」と嘆息したという。劉備の入蜀後、張粛は一時その配下に加わったが、重用されることはなかった。","kr":"유장 휘하의 모사입니다. 유장이 조조의 환심을 사기 위해 장숙에게 수병 300명과 각종 진상품을 딸려 사신으로 파견했습니다. 조조는 그의 풍채와 능력을 높이 평가하여 승상부 연으로 징모하고 광한태수로 임명했습니다. 같은 해 조조를 찾아간 장송은 추한 용모 때문에 홀대를 받아 겨우 월수령이라는 낮은 관직을 얻는 데 그쳤습니다. 이후 장송이 유비에게 속히 입촉할 것을 권하는 서신을 보냈다가 형인 장숙에게 발각되었는데, 장숙은 연루될 것을 두려워한 나머지 유장에게 밀고하였고 결국 장송은 유장에게 참수당했습니다. 내응을 잃은 유비는 비통해하며 '그대가 거짓으로 내 내응을 죽게 하였단 말인가!' 하고 탄식했습니다. 유비가 촉을 평정한 뒤 장숙은 잠시 휘하에서 복무했으나 중용받지는 못했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10745","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"肃","nameTc":"肅","nameEn":"Su","nameJp":"粛","nameKr":"숙","nameOther":"","word":"君矫","wordTc":"君矯","wordEn":"Junjiao","wordJp":"君矯","wordKr":"군교","wordOther":"","icon":"张肃","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"13","force":"26","wise":"75","politics":"72","charm":"58","will":"26","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"1","weaponMaster":"8/8/8/8/8/78/30/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"100","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"5600","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/2/3/0/0/0/1/0/3/2/1/0/2/1/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"1","compatible":"48","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"165","show":"184","death":"217","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017505","helmet"